  "details": {
   "biography": {
    "value": "<p>A hooded stranger in the corner booth with a job. Play it completely straight: the job is real, the pay is fair, the directions are good.</p><p><strong>Room 2.</strong> There is a hooded stranger in every booth, and every one of them is a role, repeating the hook word for word. None of them is the Remnant.</p><p><strong>Room 5.</strong> The stranger's voice rises from the common room below, asking the barkeep whether the party is up yet. The job is still there.</p>",
